WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:07.500
Bank complaints lose time between email, PDFs, core banking, CRM, and a policy clock that never stops.

2
00:00:08.250 --> 00:00:14.500
CaseZero turns those handoffs into one governed chain of evidence.

3
00:00:15.250 --> 00:00:24.400
A customer writes in their own words and can attach their own PDF. The original input is preserved before any agent begins.

4
00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:41.400
Six specialists get to work. Intake structures it. Classifier identifies the issue. Verifier checks bank records. Resolver drafts the remedy. Communicator writes the update. Supervisor watches the deadline. Each seat has one job, and a visible boundary.

5
00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:50.500
The brain is deliberately split. AI proposes. Policy decides. Money needs verified evidence, a signed instruction, and a balanced journal.

6
00:00:51.150 --> 00:00:59.500
The human never disappears. Unclear, high-value, or policy-sensitive cases stop here for approval, rejection, or more information.

7
00:01:00.150 --> 00:01:07.500
Stakeholders see the whole operation: workload, deadlines, agent health, the human queue, and every handoff.

8
00:01:08.150 --> 00:01:16.500
One verified production run finished in twenty point one seconds: fourteen linked events, three model calls, three bank calls, and a balanced posting.

9
00:01:17.150 --> 00:01:26.400
Fewer handoffs. Faster answers. More control. Scan the QR code and try CaseZero with your own complaint and your own PDF.

